  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ロトムパワーの　ひとつ。\nいっていじかん　レベルの　たかい\nやせいポケモンと　であいやすくなる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "로토무파워 중 하나.\n일정 시간 레벨이 높은\n야생 포켓몬과 만나기 쉬워진다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "洛托姆之力的一種。\n在一定時間內可以變得\n容易遇見等級高的野生寶可夢。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une des Motism’Auras. Elle permet de rencontrer\nplus de Pokémon sauvages de haut niveau durant\nune période déterminée.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese Rotom-Kraft bewirkt, dass wilde Pokémon\nmit hohem Level für eine bestimmte Zeit viel\nhäufiger erscheinen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Poder Rotom que aumenta la probabilidad de\nencontrar Pokémon salvajes de nivel alto durante\nun tiempo determinado.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Potere Rotom che aumenta le probabilità\ndi incontrare Pokémon selvatici di livello alto\nper un certo lasso di tempo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One of the Rotom Powers.\nIt increases the chance of encountering high-level\nwild Pokémon a lot for a certain period of time.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
